The MD model of a spherical diamond indenter against a wurtzite ZnO single crystal specimen and a schematic view of the c-plane (0001), m-plane (
101¯0

) and a-planes (11
2¯0
) of a ZnO single crystal. The red circles represent Zn atoms, and purple circles represent O atoms. The black arrows point to the top view and side view of the crystal structure.
